
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ht">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#061b48">
  <title>CASH BY CASH</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #06142f;
      color: white;
    }

    header {
      padding: 20px;
      background: #08265c;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #ffcc00;
    }

    header h1 {
      color: #ffcc00;
      font-size: 27px;
    }

    header p {
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 55px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero h2 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .hero span {
      color: #ffcc00;
    }

    .hero p {
      color: #d3def5;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 25px;
      padding: 14px 25px;
      background: #ffcc00;
      color: #06142f;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .services {
      padding: 25px 15px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .services h2 {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .service {
      padding: 25px 10px;
      background: #102d61;
      border: 1px solid #2855a0;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    .service h3 {
      color: #ffcc00;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 35px;
      padding: 25px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #020b1c;
      color: #c5d2eb;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <h1>💳 CASH BY CASH</h1>
    <p>Transfè • Acha • Peye • Vann</p>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <h2>Byenveni sou <span>CASH BY CASH</span></h2>

    <p>
      Yon sèl platfòm, plizyè posibilite!
      Dekouvri sèvis nou yo an USD ak HTG.
    </p>

    <a href="#services" class="btn">
      Dekouvri sèvis yo
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="services" id="services">
    <h2>Sèvis nou yo</h2>

    <div class="grid">

      <div class="service">
        <h3>💸 Transfè</h3>
        <p>Enfòmasyon sou transfè lajan.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="service">
        <h3>🛒 Acha</h3>
        <p>Achte pwodwi sou entènèt.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="service">
        <h3>💳 Peman</h3>
        <p>Gade sèvis peman nou yo.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="service">
        <h3>🏪 Vann</h3>
        <p>Prezante pwodwi ou yo.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <h3>CASH BY CASH</h3>
    <p>Yon sèl platfòm, plizyè posibilite!</p>
    <p>© 2026 CASH BY CASH</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
